        <mxCell id="11yVR2ZVfJo7jN54lwH--57" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;Variables&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;op - Over production&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;dm - Degree minutes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;hp_cd_timer - Heatpump frequency change Cooldown timer (6 h) (starts count from the last time the frequency has been changed&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;comp_timer - counts time pased from last time compressor turned on/off&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
